{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter and Online Dating"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Oh I Wish ..."}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 11}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Present Perfect Continuous vs Present Perfect Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way.  <br/><br/> You use the Present Perfect Continuous tense to describe:  <ul><li>a single activity that lasts a long time, and</li><li>  an action that is repeated over a long period of time.</li></ul> These continue up to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the Perfect tense (Present or Continuous), you think about <span class=\"underline\">the past and present together</span>. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "To emphasize the <span class=\"underline\">action</span>, you use the Continuous form.  <br> The structure of the Present Perfect Continuous tense is: <span class=\"strong\">subject + have + been + v-ing </span><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I've been looking for that special someone for a while now.</li><li> I've been reading comics since I was a kid.</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To emphasize the <span class=\"underline\">result </span> of the action, use the Simple form. <br> The structure of the Present Perfect tense is: <span class=\"strong\">subject + has/have + past participle </span><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>It seems that I have been unlucky so far. </li><li> I've fallen in love before, but I've always been afraid of commitment.</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've always been fascinated by people who don't let their emotions betray their true feelings. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've been checking my profile every day but I haven't found you yet."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fascinated "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "strongly attracted to something or someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've always been fascinated by people who love comic books."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le11ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in an online dating profile."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fall in love"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to have strong romantic feelings for someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've fallen in love with a girl who loves comic books."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le11ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "commitment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " being dedicated to something or someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've fallen in love before, but I've been afraid of commitment."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le11ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spellbinding"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "capable to captivate someone's attention completely"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm worried that my personality isn't spellbinding enough"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le11ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "intimidating"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " daunting; makes you feel inferior"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I wish I didn't find serious relationships so intimidating."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le11ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to betray"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to show  something without meaning to do it"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't let my emotions betray my true feelings."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le11ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "captivated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " showing great attraction to something or someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to feel captivated by a conversation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le11ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le11ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read Peter's profile again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write your own profile (12-14 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Express your feelings and preferences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about your wishes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give your profile to your partner to read."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your partner's profile. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss whether you are compatible."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about feelings and reactions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about relationships and friendships."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share opinions about friendships and relationships."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about social activities, feelings and reactions. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about things I have been doing and things I have done. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations."}, {"type": "Free H